    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh...! Look out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 15,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ouch!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "S-sorry, I didn't mean to run into you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it. You're very polite.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Ehehe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, ma'am, what are you doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's still raining. You're not going to go inside?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, um... I'm just... taking a walk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you looking for help?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh! How'd you know?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't tell you~ It's a secret.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Aw... it's fine though!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ma'am, do you think...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... that probably won't work. You're a bit too short...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you shouldn't say stuff like that! You're shorter than me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "W-well, we could try... Um, could you help me move that board? Let's do it together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a record player under that metal rack. I want to take it back home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "1... 2... 3! Together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "We did it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Woah, you're really strong, ma'am! Thank you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... this record player is broken.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay! It's always been broken.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "But one day, I'll be able to fix it. I collected a lot of records, but I've never listened to them before...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "...But one day, I'll play them for everyone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Such a difficult thing, said so casually...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What am I doing this for... What can I even do...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Ma'am, you're not scared of me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Scared of what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm an Infected!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha... I am too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "What?! That's such a pity. You're so pretty, too...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nothing wrong with being an Infected. Whether you are healthy or infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're a good person, that will never change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...? I don't get it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Grrrrrr...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Are you hungry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mmhm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Here, take this. It's all I have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow! Thank you, ma'am!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... why did you come here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "It's because...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#10"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's because I made a promise to someone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Bye bye, ma'am!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, bye bye!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Even a child like that... In the end, will just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those who were robbed of their identity. The Infected. You've long lost the right to call yourselves people."
    },
    {
        "text": "What can I accomplish? What more... can I do...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why... can I not protect those around me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You cannot."
    },
    {
        "text": "No... I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Famine... Persecution... Death..."
    },
    {
        "text": "These are the only things awaiting the Infected."
    },
    {
        "text": "No, that's not true...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as Rhodes Island is fighting for the Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are but one of the few lucky ones."
    },
    {
        "text": "No... We've all come together to fight towards a common goal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This world has already become cold and callous."
    },
    {
        "text": "No, not yet...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected can't succumb to despair just yet...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You."
    },
    {
        "text": "Allow the rage to consume you."
    },
    {
        "text": "Only then..."
    },
